==Icelandic==
{{cardinalbox|is|0|1|2|núll|tveir|ord=fyrstur}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|einn}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*ainaz}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{m|ine-pro|*óynos}}. Compare Faroese and Norwegian Nynorsk {{m|fo|ein}}, Danish, Swedish, and Norwegian Bokmål {{m|da|en}}.

===Numeral===
'''einn''' {{g|m}}, '''[[ein]]''' {{g|f}}, '''[[eitt]]''' {{g|n}}

# '''[[one]]'''; the cardinal number after [[núll#Icelandic|núll]] and before [[tveir#Icelandic|tveir]].
# accusative masculine singular form of [[einn#Icelandic|einn]]

